PASS one-click conversation: automatic speech turns, replies and resumed listening across multiple turns with one microphone
PASS local turn: recording → STT → transcript → Copilot → TTS; accurate progress and blocked-playback recovery without any repeated request
PASS hands-free speech never implicitly reviews or confirms an action proposal
